OL,5,G1300 History Hunters
OL,6,     FA former dealer is selling his
OL,7,     Fentire medal collection - will
OL,8,     FDave and Steve find anything worth
OL,9,     Fbidding for? And Steve digs deep
OL,10,     Finto a WW1 army medic's family
OL,11,     Fhistory.
OL,12,G1400 History Hunters
OL,13,     FThe team acquire a personalised
OL,14,     FVictorian pistol, but can they
OL,15,     Ftrack down the original owner? And
OL,16,     Fa customer brings in brasses that
OL,17,     Fhis dad brought back from the
OL,18,     FSomme.
